  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECONOMIC INTEGRATION FOR WOMEN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solidaridad seeks to provide an integrated response to poverty through work with women, offering education in politics and women&apos;s rights in addition to issues more directly related to their economic activities. 

The project is helping women in Lomas de Carabayllo, a community in the province of Lima, to build on their skills in craftmaking and baking to improve the quality of products and supporting them to set up a women&apos;s network with a principal objective of increasing income. Solidaridad will also be helping the women to promote local development initiatives to benefit women, providing them with a platform to exercise their economic and social rights.</narrative>
  </description>
